'''Electro''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] [[:Category:Pets|pet]] that was orignally obtainable by purchasing the [[Futuristic Item Pack]] for 899 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since went offsale.

== Appearance ==
Electro is an electronic bird-looking pet with blue LED lights visibly seen on its eyes, chest, and upper tail. The rest of bird is a solid black with machinery parts on it. 

== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/92627975/Orinthian-Falcon Orinthian Falcon], purchasable from the avatar shop for 525 Robux. However, it has been altered to a darker color scheme.
*It partners with the godly knife [[Virtual]] and the godly gun [[Blaster]], making the '''Full Virtual Set.''' 

